<title>GERMANY: Metro H1 profits up, sales flat.</title>
<headline>Metro H1 profits up, sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30. (in millions of marks unless stated).</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before goodwill   181	 vs 48</p>
<p>    Group sales			    29,092	 vs 29,195</p>
<p>NOTE - Newly-merged German retail group Metro was listed on the Frankfurt stock exchange in the summer.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
